  ">
    <a href="https://www.express.co.uk/news/uk/2180272/teleware-limited-york-administration" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Teleware Limited, a UK technology firm based in Easingwold near York, has collapsed after 30 years in business and entered administration</a>. Teleware developed communication software that helped organisations improve workplace communication and productivity, particularly through Microsoft-based solutions. The company worked with major clients including British Airways, Bank of England, Sainsbury's, Samsung, the NHS, Bupa, and Barclays.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
