          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 !important">
    Prince Andrew once joked in 2008 that the <a href="https://uk.news.yahoo.com/fact-check-ex-prince-andrew-140000801.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">royal family avoids playing Monopoly</a> because “it gets too vicious.” The comment, reported by The Telegraph, was made when he declined a Monopoly gift at an event.
  </p>
